  "comments": "<p><u>Details of different types</u>:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6597c88d20668.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6597c88d20668.jpg\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6597c89fd2a23.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6597c89fd2a23.jpg\"></a></p><p><strong>P#154a/b/d/e (1978 to 1994)</strong> - with printer name (CASA DE MONEDA DE CHILE); with designer (D. BUSSE) and engraver name (M. SIMPSON).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6597c976f3c5d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6597c976f3c5d.jpg\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6597c9803d0b3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6597c9803d0b3.jpg\"></a></p><p><strong>P#154f (1995 to 2001)</strong> - with printer name (CASA DE MONEDA DE CHILE); without designer and engraver names.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6597ca80378f3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6597ca80378f3.jpg\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6597ca90a1df3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6597ca90a1df3.jpg\"></a></p><p><strong>P#154f (1999 and 2001 to 2005)</strong> - without printer name (CASA DE MONEDA DE CHILE); without tactile mark.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6597cb11b4fd1.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6597cb11b4fd1.jpg\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6597cb1a167a3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6597cb1a167a3.jpg\"></a></p><p><strong>P#154g (2006 to 2009)</strong> - without printer name (CASA DE MONEDA DE CHILE); with tactile mark (one vertical bar).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.